# reject-obo-duplicate — an actor declares at most one delegator: a second
# on-behalf-of on the same actor declaration is ill-formed at apply (§6). Both
# named delegators are declared and no grant amplifies; only the at-most-one
# rule rejects.
actor boss
actor chief
actor sub on-behalf-of boss on-behalf-of chief
gate g risk low grant boss[deploy:low] chief[deploy:low] sub[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
